- Separate **verified by running code**, **derived on paper**, **inferred**.
- Reuse the prior report's tape, anchors, and power vectors so the two are comparable; cite
  its per-anchor power-vector SHA-256 values and re-verify them.
- If a rule is infeasible within the budget, say so; do not substitute a proxy silently.

